{"id":"n62264-1-19","stage":1,"title":"기다리다 · 等","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62264-1-19-1","ko":"십 분만 기다려 줘.","zh":"请再等我十分钟吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"십","meaning":"十","explanation":"십：十","readings":[{"term":"십","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89595","senseId":"1","lemma":"십","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"분만","meaning":"分，分钟","explanation":"분：分，分钟；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70891","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기다려","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줘.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c7470d030eddae16","term":"십","zh":"十","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3","entryId":"89595","definition":"十的。","pronunciation":["십"]},{"id":"ca4a187881dbf529","term":"분","zh":"分，分钟","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3","entryId":"70891","definition":"计时单位，表示一个小时的六十分之一。","pronunciation":["분"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3","entryId":"62264","definition":"直到人、时机到来或某事完成为止，一直打发时间。","pronunciation":["기다리다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6615ac95fa9505c10173.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62264-1-19-2","ko":"약속 장소에 있을 테니까 빨리 와.","zh":"我会在约定的地点，你快点过来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"약속","meaning":"约定，约好，承诺","explanation":"약속：约定，约好，承诺","readings":[{"term":"약속","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36695","senseId":"1","lemma":"약속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"장소에","meaning":"场所，地点","explanation":"장소：场所，地点；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"장소","audio":"/audio/61eaecc09cb7e53dbc6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30185","senseId":"1","lemma":"장소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있을","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"테니까","meaning":"表示打算、推测或意志。","explanation":"터：表示打算、推测或意志。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"터","audio":"/audio/cfabc7b0ff6f800c4a76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72183","senseId":"1","lemma":"터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"와.","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a39ee87db456831e","term":"약속","zh":"约定，约好，承诺","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3","entryId":"36695","definition":"事先决定与他人一起做某事；或指那样定下的内容。","pronunciation":["약쏙"]},{"id":"61eaecc09cb7e53d","term":"장소","zh":"场所，地点","audio":"/audio/61eaecc09cb7e53dbc6e.mp3","entryId":"30185","definition":"某事发生的地方；或指进行某事的地方。","pronunciation":["장소"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在，待，住","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物停留或居住在某个地方。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"cfabc7b0ff6f800c","term":"터","zh":"表示打算、推测或意志。","audio":"/audio/cfabc7b0ff6f800c4a76.mp3","entryId":"72183","definition":"表示打算、推测或意志。","pronunciation":["터"]},{"id":"a5443c04aa0fdc08","term":"빨리","zh":"快，赶快","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3","entryId":"57305","definition":"花费的时间不长地。","pronunciation":["빨리"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/271d0cd2b9902edda161.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.44,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62264","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":34,"sequenceScore":1.5178,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["请再等我十分钟吧。","我会在约定的地点，你快点过来。","我上学时总是考第一。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["请再等我十分钟吧。","我会在约定的地点，你快点过来。","我上学时总是考第一。"],"answer":1}]}
